---
// Panels.astro - Wersja zoptymalizowana pod wydajność i konwersję
---
<section id="oferta" class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    
    <header class="max-w-3xl mb-16 lg:mb-24">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-green-600">Rozwiązania 2026</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mb-8 leading-tight">
        Raportowanie, które <span class="text-green-600">pracuje na Ciebie.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Zapomnij o ręcznym kopiowaniu danych. Wybierz rozwiązanie, które zamieni godziny pracy w sekundy.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <a href="/uslugi/dashboardy-power-bi/" class="group block p-10 rounded-[40px] bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-green-500/30 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <i class="fas fa-chart-pie text-green-600 text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">Usługi Power BI</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Projektujemy interaktywne dashboardy KPI, które aktualizują się same. Dane dostępne na telefonie i komputerze 24/7.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500">Dashboardy</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500">DAX</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500">Cloud</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/uslugi/excel-na-zamowienie/" class="group block p-10 rounded-[40px] bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-green-500/30 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <i class="fas fa-file-excel text-green-600 text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">Excel na zamówienie</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Budujemy zaawansowane <strong>arkusze na zamówienie</strong>. Makra VBA, Power Query i pełna automatyzacja raportów.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500">VBA</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500">Power Query</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-indigo-600 italic">+ Integracja AI</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="p-10 rounded-[40px] bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-green-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-sm">
          <i class="fas fa-microchip text-slate-400 text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">Analiza & Automatyzacja</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Łączymy dane z systemów ERP, SQL i API. Eliminujemy błędy ludzkie dzięki skryptom Python i SQL.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Data ETL</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">SQL Engine</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/kontakt/" class="group block p-10 rounded-[40px] bg-slate-950 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-slate-900/40 relative overflow-hidden transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]">
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-green-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 relative z-10 shadow-lg shadow-green-600/20">
          <i class="fas fa-rocket text-white text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter relative z-10">Naprawa & Konsultacje</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 relative z-10">
          Twój plik wolno działa? Potrzebujesz nagłej pomocy eksperta? Oferujemy <strong>naprawę plików Excel</strong> i doradztwo.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-slate-950 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight relative z-10 group-hover:bg-green-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          Darmowa konsultacja 
          <i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
        </span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Usunięto wszystkie filtry blur i skomplikowane cienie, które cięły stronę */
  section {
    content-visibility: auto;
    contain-intrinsic-size: 1px 1000px;
  }
</style>